  "Search covers the imported catalog across all pages and image types. The comparison count shows indexed images and any unavailable files. Visual similarity does not guarantee an exact match.": "搜图覆盖已接入目录的全部分页及图片类型，比较数量会显示已索引图片与不可用文件。视觉相似度不保证同款。",
