  "Failed to load: ": "加载失败：",
  "This image could not be read. Try a JPG or PNG.": "无法读取图片，请尝试 JPG 或 PNG。",
  "Find it. Check it. Make it yours.": "发现商品，核对，再下单",
  "A practical first-order checklist.": "第一单的实用核对清单。",
  "Start with the original listing. Compare the available photos and read the size information before opening the product with Oopbuy. A catalog listing is a starting point, not a guarantee of stock or quality.": "先查看原商品链接，比较可用图片并确认尺码，再跳转 Oopbuy。目录展示不代表商品一定有货，也不构成质量保证。",
  "Copy the original link, choose the correct option on the buying platform, and review the total before payment. Keep your order reference so you can find the same item later.": "复制原链接，在购买平台选择正确款式，付款前核对总额，并保存订单编号。",
  "What to look for in your QC photos": "QC 照片应该检查什么",
  "Small details. Better decisions.": "检查细节，帮助判断。",
  "Compare the received item with the option you ordered. Check the overall shape, color, stitching, labels and visible damage. Ask for a measurement photo when fit is important.": "将收到的商品与订单款式对照，检查外形、颜色、走线、标签和明显损坏。对尺码敏感时，要求提供带尺子的测量照片。",
  "Seller photos and warehouse QC photos are different evidence. Source gallery inspection photos are labeled as QC references when a measurement ruler is visible; their warehouse provenance is not independently verified.": "卖家图与仓库质检图属于不同证据。源站图库中可见测量尺的实拍图标记为 QC 参考图，仓库来源尚未独立核验。",
  "Understand the cost beyond the price tag": "了解商品价格之外的费用",
  "Plan your parcel before checkout.": "购买前先规划包裹。",
  "An item price is not a delivered price. Consider domestic delivery, international freight, optional services and any destination charges. Check the current checkout and route terms on the buying platform.": "商品标价并不是到手总价。还需考虑境内配送、国际运费、可选服务以及目的地相关费用。具体以购买平台结算和线路规则为准。",
  "Compare the packed dimensions and actual weight. If a route uses volumetric weight, its divisor and rounding rules affect the billable weight. The calculator here is illustrative and does not quote Oopbuy freight.": "比较打包后体积与实际重量。若线路使用体积重，计算系数和进位规则都会影响计费重量。本站计算器仅辅助计算，不是 Oopbuy 运费报价。",
  "A better way to check your size": "如何核对尺码",
  "Measure a piece you already own.": "用合身衣物作对照。",
  "Compare garment measurements with a similar item that fits you. A size letter alone is not a consistent measurement across sellers.": "测量一件合身的同类衣物，再与商品尺码表逐项比较。不同卖家的尺码字母并不是统一的尺寸。",
  "For shoes, check the seller’s size chart and ask for measurements where available. Recheck the selected size before payment.": "鞋履请先核对卖家尺码表，有条件时索取测量信息。付款前再次确认选中的尺码。",
  "Keep the original product link handy": "保存原始商品链接",
  "One product, multiple buying options.": "同一商品，多种购买入口。",
  "The marketplace item ID identifies the listing. Copy the Weidian link from the product page to keep a reference you can use with a compatible buying platform.": "平台商品 ID 用来识别商品链接。可从详情页复制微店原链接，保存或粘贴到兼容的购买平台。",
  "Agent links can open the same listing, but the final options, fees and availability can differ. Confirm all details after you leave this site.": "不同代购入口可能指向同一商品，但可选款式、费用和可用状态可能不同。跳转后请重新核对。",
  "Search beyond the cover photo": "不要只搜索商品首图",
  "Use details to narrow down your find.": "用细节缩小搜索范围。",
  "Image search in this preview compares your upload with every imported product image, including gallery images. Try a clear crop with a plain background for more useful matches.": "本预览搜图会将上传图片与已导入的所有商品图片比较，包含详情图。建议裁剪主体并选用背景简洁的图片。",
  "Before you request a return": "申请退货前要核对什么",
  "Keep the evidence and check the deadline.": "保留凭证，核对时限。",
  "Check the seller’s current return conditions and the buying platform’s process before ordering. Save screenshots of the selected option and description.": "下单前查看卖家当前退货条件与购买平台流程，并保存已选款式及商品描述截图。",
  "If an issue appears in warehouse photos, raise it promptly through the platform. Eligibility, return freight and time limits must be confirmed for your order.": "如仓库图片显示问题，及时通过购买平台反馈。退货资格、运费和时限需按具体订单确认。",
  "Compare prices in your currency": "切换货币，比较商品价格",
  "A conversion is an estimate.": "换算金额仅供参考。",
  "The catalog keeps the listed CNY amount and converts it using reference exchange rates. The rate timestamp is shown on the product page.": "目录保留人民币标价，并通过参考汇率换算。商品详情会显示汇率时间。",
  "Payment provider rates, conversion spreads and fees can change the amount you actually pay. Confirm the final charge during checkout.": "支付渠道汇率、兑换差价和手续费都会影响实付金额，请以结算时显示的金额为准。",
  "Organize your warehouse items": "管理仓库中的商品",
  "Review each item before consolidation.": "合包之前逐件核对。",
  "Use your order references to match photos with the correct product and option. Keep unresolved issues separate from items you are ready to ship.": "用订单编号将图片对应到正确商品与款式。尚未解决问题的商品，与准备出库的商品分开处理。",
  "Review current storage deadlines and packing options in your account. Do not assume that every item or route supports the same handling services.": "在账户中查看当前仓储期限与打包选项，不要假设所有商品与线路都支持相同的服务。",
  "Read your parcel tracking clearly": "如何查看包裹追踪",
  "Follow the handoff, not just the label.": "关注运输节点，不只关注单号。",
  "A tracking number can be created before the carrier receives a parcel. Read the latest event and its timestamp rather than assuming the label means transit has started.": "物流单号可能在承运商收到包裹之前生成。请阅读最新节点及时间，不要仅凭单号判断已开始运输。",
  "For missing updates, check the buying platform and the carrier’s official tracking page. Ask support about the specific parcel rather than relying on another buyer’s timeline.": "如果物流长期未更新，查看购买平台与承运商官方追踪页面，并按具体包裹向客服咨询。其他买家的时效不代表本单时效。",
  "Is this the official Oopbuy website?": "这是 Oopbuy 官方网站吗？",
  "No. This is an independent product discovery preview. Orders are placed on external buying platforms.": "不是，这是独立的商品发现预览站。订单在外部购买平台完成。",
  "Can I buy directly here?": "可以在本站直接购买吗？",
  "No payment or order processing happens here. Use the buying link on a product page.": "本站不收款也不处理订单，请使用商品详情页的购买入口。",
  "Where are the original links?": "原始商品链接在哪里？",
  "Open a product and use Copy Weidian link.": "打开商品详情，点击“复制微店链接”。",
  "Does image search include gallery images?": "搜图是否包含详情图？",
  "Are image matches exact?": "搜图结果一定是同款吗？",
  "No. Results are ranked by visual similarity, not guaranteed product identity.": "不一定，结果按视觉相似度排序，不保证是同一款商品。",
  "Are these QC photos?": "这些图片是 QC 图吗？",
  "Product, detail and style images remain separate. Ruler inspection photos from the source are labeled as QC references, without independently verified warehouse provenance.": "商品、详情与款式图片分别展示。源站带尺实拍归类为 QC 参考图，仓库来源尚未独立核验。",
  "Can I change currency?": "可以切换货币吗？",
  "Yes, use the header selector. Converted prices are estimates, not checkout quotes.": "可以，使用顶部货币选择器；换算金额仅供参考，不是结算报价。",
  "Does the price include shipping?": "价格包含运费吗？",
  "No. International shipping and other charges are not included in the item price.": "不包含，商品标价不含国际运费等额外费用。",
  "How do I save a find?": "如何收藏商品？",
  "Tap the heart. Saved items stay in this browser.": "点击爱心，收藏保存在当前浏览器。",
  "Can I use another buying agent?": "可以使用其他代购平台吗？",
  "Yes. Available links appear on each product page; confirm the listing after opening.": "可以，详情页列出可用平台入口，跳转后需核对商品。",
  "Are products always in stock?": "商品始终有货吗？",
  "Availability can change. Check the marketplace or buying platform.": "库存随时变化，请在原平台或购买平台确认。",
  "How should I choose a size?": "怎样选择尺码？",
  "Compare measurements with a similar item that fits you and check the seller’s chart.": "对照卖家尺码表，并测量自己合身的同类衣物。",
  "Can I return an item?": "商品可以退货吗？",
  "Conditions depend on the seller and your order. Confirm the current policy before payment.": "需按卖家与订单条件判断，付款前确认现行政策。",
  "How is shipping calculated?": "运费怎么计算？",
  "Routes may use actual or volumetric weight and their own rounding rules. Get a current route quote.": "线路可能按实际重量或体积重计费，并有各自进位规则，请获取当前线路报价。",
  "Does this site guarantee authenticity?": "本站保证商品正品吗？",
  "No. Product images and listing links cannot establish authenticity.": "不保证，仅凭商品图片与链接无法鉴定真伪。",
  "Is an account required here?": "本站需要注册账户吗？",
  "No account is required to browse this preview. External platforms may require one.": "浏览预览不需要注册，外部购买平台可能需要账户。",
  "Where is my uploaded image stored?": "上传图片保存在哪里？",
  "Image comparison runs in your browser. This preview does not upload your search image to a server.": "图片比较在浏览器本地进行，本预览不将搜图图片上传至服务器。",
  "Why does the final price differ?": "为什么最终价格不同？",
  "Listing changes, exchange rates, options and platform fees can affect the final charge.": "商品价格变化、汇率、款式和平台费用都可能影响实付金额。",
  "How do I track an order?": "在哪里追踪订单？",
  "Use the platform where you placed the order and the carrier’s official tracking page.": "使用下单平台以及承运商官方物流查询页面。",
